<%#
  The one notification surface for the whole site.

  A live region so a screen reader announces the same result a sighted
  visitor sees. `pointer-events: none` on the container keeps it from
  covering anything the visitor is trying to click.
%>
<div
    class="toast-region js-toast-region"
    role="status"
    aria-live="polite"
    aria-atomic="false"
></div>
